{"v":1,"seq":10,"ts":"2026-11-21T13:31:52.233Z","job":"ball-paddle-walled-court-20261121-1","type":"brief_set","brief":{"rules":"Two paddles, one ball. A ball passing a paddle scores for the other side. First to 5 wins.","arena":"A flat court 16 m by 9 m with walls on the long sides and open goal lines on the short sides.","ai":"The opponent paddle follows the ball with a reaction delay and a speed cap.","controls":"paddle_up and paddle_down move the player's paddle along the goal line.","mood":"Flat-shaded blocks, two team colours, soft top light.","pitch":"Bank the ball past Rival Rex, brace his smash, win at sudden death.","aspects":[{"id":"paddle","icon":"player","title":"Your paddle","line":"Slide along your goal and slap the ball back","detail":"paddle_up and paddle_down; a return speeds the ball up a little","alternatives":[{"id":"two_paddles","title":"Two paddles","line":"Steer a front and a back paddle at once"},{"id":"spinner","title":"A spinning bat","line":"Spin to whack the ball at an angle"}]},{"id":"rival","icon":"rival","title":"Rival Rex","line":"A greedy paddle that lunges at every ball","detail":"TLSteer.intercept_point with a reaction delay; lunges leave his corner open","alternatives":[{"id":"twin_rivals","title":"Twin rivals","line":"Two small paddles share the far goal"},{"id":"wall_bot","title":"The wall","line":"No rival: beat your own best rally"}]},{"id":"court","icon":"arena","title":"Walled court","line":"Walls bounce the ball, goals behind each end","detail":"16 m by 9 m, walls on the long sides, a kit rink floor for a fast slide","alternatives":[{"id":"ice_court","title":"Ice court","line":"Everything slides faster on ice"},{"id":"round_court","title":"Round court","line":"A ring with four goals"}]}],"design":{"pillars":[{"line":"Every return is a read","rules_out":"auto-aim and a ball that tracks the paddle"},{"line":"Rex has a body and a habit","rules_out":"a recoloured copy of the player"},{"line":"Speed is earned","rules_out":"a flat speed boost"}],"verbs":[{"id":"slap","input":"paddle_hit (space)","anticipation_f":4,"active_f":3,"recovery_f":12,"cancel":"none"},{"id":"brace","input":"paddle_brace (shift)","anticipation_f":2,"active_f":20,"recovery_f":8,"cancel":"slap","defensive":true}],"playstyles":[{"id":"wall_banker","title":"Wall banker","line":"Bank shots off the walls past Rex"},{"id":"brick","title":"The brick","line":"Brace and punish his lunges"}],"loops":{"s3":"read the ball, slap or brace","s30":"a rally that speeds up until someone scores","m3":"first to five against Rex"},"context":["the ball speeds up every return","Rex lunges when he trails","the last point is sudden death"],"skill":{"floor":"slap the ball back","ceiling":["bank shots","brace into a counter slap","bait the lunge of Rex"]},"feel":{"hitstop_f":[3,6],"knockback":"the ball leaves faster the later the slap","reaction":"Rex staggers 8 frames when beaten","whiff":"a swish and a 12-frame recovery","iframes_f":14,"telegraph_f":24,"shake":"only on a goal","camera":"fixed view of the whole court from the side, low walls"},"clips":[{"id":"bank_past_rex","moment":"a bank shot that beats the lunge of Rex"},{"id":"brace_counter","moment":"a brace that turns his smash back at him"},{"id":"sudden_death","moment":"the last point at full speed"}],"first_minute":"the ball comes slow; one hint line: space slaps","fail_state":"Rex scores five; the end screen names your best rally","out_of_scope":["power-ups","a second rival"]},"concept":{"candidates":[{"pitch":"Classic paddle duel against a rival.","likelihood":0.8},{"pitch":"Paddle duel where walls bank shots past Rival Rex.","likelihood":0.3},{"pitch":"A paddle duel on ice.","likelihood":0.4},{"pitch":"Four-goal ring paddle brawl.","likelihood":0.15},{"pitch":"Paddle tennis against your own ghost.","likelihood":0.1}],"chosen":1,"why":"Bank shots give a skill ceiling; the classic duel has none.","hook":"bank shots past a lunging rival","anchor":"arcade paddle duel","references":[{